1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,479
A sunflower a metre tall can stand on its primary tissues alone.

2
00:00:04,479 --> 00:00:07,473
A sal tree thirty metres tall cannot.

3
00:00:07,473 --> 00:00:15,820
As a woody plant adds height and leaves, its young body can neither carry the load nor pipe enough water to the crown.

4
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:17,109
So it adds girth.

